B.O8=new A.bE(B.OK,["The control: fountain_pen's ink, drawn through the same mesh and shader.","Each tube lights as the pen reaches it; light runs the way each stroke was written.","Hot where the pen has just been: each point cools by when the pen passed it.","Ink spreads as it dries, furthest where the pen went slowly or came down.","Each stroke a two-faced ribbon, twisting along it; the mesh itself waves.","Joints: each one flashes and throws sparks as the pen reaches it, then cools.","Joints: each one a star as the pen reaches it. Joins gold, touches blue, crossings pink.","The ink freezes as it's written; frost feathers grow, and ice forms first where strokes meet.","Spider silk, pinned at its joints: it sags with a bounce once written, sways, and gathers dew.","Branches grow as the pen goes; blossoms open at the joints and shed petals on the breeze.","A vine climbs each stroke behind the pen, twining round it; leaves open, tendrils reach and coil.","Soft: the pen drags the jelly it writes on; when it lifts, the jelly springs back and wobbles still.","Snow settles only where an edge faces up, deeper the longer the ink has lain there.","Fireflies rise from the ink; blinking each to its own rhythm, they fall into step."],t.li)
